WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Just let it go and go upstairs.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,580
treat me like air

3
00:00:04,580 --> 00:00:05,580
Okay, you can

4
00:00:05,580 --> 00:00:07,580
If you have money, you can do whatever you want, right?

5
00:00:07,580 --> 00:00:08,580
Laughing flower

6
00:00:08,580 --> 00:00:10,580
A cold goddess who is regarded as a deity by tens of thousands of boys in the school

7
00:00:10,580 --> 00:00:13,580
In Zhang Tong's hands, it was as docile as a kitten.

8
00:00:13,580 --> 00:00:16,580
Why is the gap between humans bigger than humans and dogs?

9
00:00:16,580 --> 00:00:17,580
I don’t want women anymore

10
00:00:17,580 --> 00:00:19,580
Let’s first see what good stuff Brother Tong got back this time.

11
00:00:19,580 --> 00:00:20,580
More than one billion

12
00:00:20,580 --> 00:00:22,580
I want to see if the boast is broken.

13
00:00:24,050 --> 00:00:25,050
What the hell is this?

14
00:00:25,050 --> 00:00:29,220
Why are they all fruits?

15
00:00:29,220 --> 00:00:30,220
This is grape

16
00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:32,220
One is bigger than a goose egg

17
00:00:32,220 --> 00:00:33,220
Cheap variety

18
00:00:33,220 --> 00:00:34,220
Neither like Apple

19
00:00:34,220 --> 00:00:35,220
Not like a sweet peach

20
00:00:35,220 --> 00:00:36,220
I've eaten all over the country

21
00:00:36,220 --> 00:00:38,220
Why have I never seen this thing on the market?

22
00:00:38,220 --> 00:00:41,940
my god

23
00:00:41,940 --> 00:00:43,940
How can it be so sweet and delicious?

24
00:00:43,940 --> 00:00:44,940
So cool

25
00:00:44,940 --> 00:00:45,940
There is enough juice to penetrate even the internal organs.

26
00:00:45,940 --> 00:00:47,940
Where did Zhang Tong get those chicken skins and wild fruits?

27
00:00:47,940 --> 00:00:48,940
Fruit of this quality

28
00:00:48,940 --> 00:00:49,940
If it were shipped to the top wealthy people with high-quality materials in the north,

29
00:00:49,940 --> 00:00:51,940
If one sells for hundreds of yuan, people will line up.
